<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">05072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Vladimir Putin and Donald Trump spoke for ninety minutes on the weekend the United States marked its two hundred fiftieth year... even as Ukrainian drones struck an oil refinery inside St Petersburg itself.</s> <s>Kyiv says these strikes have now disabled forty-three percent of Russia's refining capacity, choking the revenue that funds the war.</s> <s>The fighting and the deal-making are advancing at once — and neither capital will say which one wins.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Police in Pakistan's Gwadar district found five bullet-riddled bodies dumped along a roadside; only two have been named.</s> <s>Balochistan has recorded years of unexplained killings tied to security operations around the Chinese-funded port, where civilians become the uncounted cost of insurgency and the response to it.</s> <s>Three of the dead remain unclaimed, and no suspects have been named.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Yemen's deputy prime minister raised his country's blockade in Tehran, where Iran's foreign minister pledged to use every diplomatic channel to lift it.</s> <s>The siege has kept a population on the edge of famine for years, while the world's attention stays fixed on Gaza and Ukraine.</s> <s>No timeline was set — and the blockade grinds on regardless of the promises.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's Middle East minister, Hamish Falconer, walked away from questions in Whitehall about why the state lets its citizens serve in Israel's military.</s> <s>A freedom-of-information release shows thousands of Britons have joined that army since Gaza's war began in twenty twenty-three, even as Britain prosecutes citizens who fight elsewhere abroad.</s> <s>The Foreign Office won't say whether it screens returning fighters at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's Nigerian consulate says four of its citizens have now died in a wave of anti-foreigner violence, one tortured to death by metro police in Pretoria.</s> <s>The country's economic anxiety is being channelled against black African migrants, while its own sweeps have detained roughly nine hundred people this week.</s> <s>An investigation into the earlier deaths stays open after two months, with no arrests made.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Switzerland now offers homes internet speeds of twenty-five gigabits, and the reason isn't the free market — it's regulation.</s> <s>Regulators forced the country's carriers to share a single physical fibre network, avoiding the duplicated wiring that inflates prices in wealthier markets tied to one provider.</s> <s>Where competition was mandated at the physical layer, a natural monopoly ended up serving households rather than capturing them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sony will release its final PlayStation disc game in January twenty twenty-eight, moving fully to downloads.</s> <s>Buyers will hold marketplace licences rather than discs, ending resale, lending, and offline play the moment a platform revokes access.</s> <s>It's a quiet redefinition of ownership — you'll pay to borrow what you once held outright.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's refiners lifted cooking-gas output fifty-four percent in a single week, and Narendra Modi says diplomacy has widened the country's crude sources from twenty-six nations to more than forty.</s> <s>Ninety percent of India's cooking gas still passes through the Strait of Hormuz, the world's most contested oil chokepoint.</s> <s>Refiners absorbed more than seventy-five thousand crore rupees in losses, and Modi gave no timeline for recouping them.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Wildfires have returned to western Greenland after years of quiet, and residents describe a hazard they've no tradition of fighting.</s> <s>Arctic warming has dried the tundra and thawed ancient peat into fuel that simply didn't exist a generation ago.</s> <s>Communities built for cold must now learn to live with fire — an entirely new class of danger.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have found that a single protein, called <sub alias="new sap one">NuSAP1</sub>, builds the internal scaffold a deadly parasite needs to divide.</s> <s>Trypanosoma brucei, which causes African sleeping sickness, splits its cells using machinery distinct from our own, making that protein a clean drug target.</s> <s>No medicine based on it exists yet — but for a disease the market long ignored, it maps a route toward one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Venezuela's earthquake death toll has climbed toward three thousand, jumping by three hundred overnight in the coastal town of La Guaira.</s> <s>Two quakes of magnitude seven-point-two and seven-point-five struck ten days ago, well past the seventy-two-hour window when rescues usually succeed.</s> <s>Tens of thousands are still missing as international teams begin winding their search down.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada's western provinces, British Columbia and Alberta, have set weaker safety buffers between fracking wells and people's homes.</s> <s>Fracking pumps chemical-laced water underground, and the country's plan to double its electricity capacity by twenty fifty leans on the gas those wells produce.</s> <s>More drilling now creeps toward residential land as that build-out proceeds.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A study of six hundred and five rural users in remote China found that digital literacy measurably lifted their sense of well-being.</s> <s>The gain was strongest among the most socially isolated — connectivity alone changed little, but the skill to use it substituted for the community that distance had thinned.</s> <s>Closing the access gap, the researchers argue, is only half the work; the literacy gap is what turns a network into welfare.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Egypt and its neighbours, citizen journalists are silencing themselves before they ever hit publish.</s> <s>A study across three states found that vague laws and digital monitoring make the chilling effect operate long before any post is removed, quietly narrowing the record of what publics are allowed to witness.</s> <s>Censorship has migrated from the printing press to the platform — and often that citizen video is the only independent evidence left.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>